Short : HD-Installer for Dalek Attack v1.2
Type : game/patch
Author :  Bored Seal

This patch applies to "Dalek Attack" by Alternative (c) 1992 - 2 disks.
Slave requires WHDLOAD V10+.
Game requires 1MB ChipRAM (+ 1.6MB RAM for PreLoad)

FEATURES:
- Game loads entirely from HD
- Manual protection removed
- Access faults fixed (3x)
- Highscores will be saved
- Trainer option (set CUSTOM1=1 for Player1 unlimited lives)
- NI/ROM icon (created by JHZ)
- Quit option (your default key)

HISTORY:
V1.0 (19-Apr-2001) - first release
V1.1 (14-Jul-2006) - expansion memory usage, taglist fixed to work with WHDLoad v16.6
V1.2 (23-Jul-2009) - gfx sprite bugs fixed -> ChipRAM used instead expansion memory
                   - another access fault fixed, "division by zero" errors removed

KNOWN BUGS:
- Game display is trashed sometimes at startup. Try to restart the game until it will work.
- Snoop mode freezes your computer.
- Game uses F10 for pause key, select different quitkey. :)

         Bug report form, full WHDLoad package and other installs:
                          http://www.whdload.de
